{
  "_about": "Keyword rules the importer uses to tag a question's topic. Per section, the first rule whose pattern matches the question (plus its options) wins; patterns are case-insensitive regular expressions. Questions nothing matches are tagged 'Miscellaneous' and listed in the import report for a hand fix.",
